For questions not covered by the skill, fetch the docs: https://dougbarrett.github.io/gux/

## Quick Start

```bash
gux dev          # Run development server (http://localhost:{{.Port}})
gux build        # Production build
gux gen          # Regenerate API client
gux clean        # Remove generated files
```

