## Development Patterns

### Page Functions

Pages follow the loader + component pattern:

```go
func MyPage(r *core.Router) func() core.Node {
    // LOADER: Runs on server (SSR) and client navigation
    var items []Item
    r.OnLoad(func() {
        api.Items.List(func(result []Item, err error) {
            if err == nil {
                items = result
            }
        })
    })

    // COMPONENT: Returns UI, re-runs on state changes
    return func() core.Node {
        return core.Div(core.Class("container"),
            renderItemList(items),
        )
    }
}
```

### State Management

```go
count := r.StateInt("count", 0)        // int
name := r.StateString("name", "")      // string
active := r.StateBool("active", false) // bool
user := core.UseState(r, "user", User{}) // any type

// Read and update
current := count.Get()
count.Set(current + 1)
name.SetQuiet("value") // Update without re-render
```

### Router Methods

```go
r.Param("id")           // Get route parameter
r.Path()                // Current path
r.Navigate("/path")     // Programmatic navigation
r.User()                // Authenticated user (or nil)
r.IsAuthenticated()     // Check if logged in
r.HasRole("admin")      // Check user role
```
