## Authentication

{{- if .PublicSignup}}
- Public registration enabled at `/register`
{{- else}}
- Admin-only authentication (no public signup)
{{- end}}
- Login at `/login`, logout via `/api/logout`
- Session stored in cookie `__{{.AppName}}_session`
- Protected routes use `.Protected()` method

### Environment Variables

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and set:
```
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-secure-password
PORT={{.Port}}
```

The admin user is created on first run.
