## Admin Panel

- Sidebar layout via `AdminLayout()` wrapper
- User management at `/admin/users`
- Dashboard at `/admin`
- All admin routes are protected (require login)
{{end}}
## Development Notes

- **Always use `gux dev`** (not `go run`) - it builds WASM and CSS
- Use `r.OnLoad()` for data fetching (supports SSR hydration)
- DTOs hide sensitive fields from API responses
- Mark cross-bundle links as `External: true`

## Generated Files (Do Not Edit)

- `guxgen/` - API client and WASM entry points
- `assets_gen.go` - Embedded assets

Run `gux gen` to regenerate after changing models or routes.
